1
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:18,420
Aiming for the sunset floating
over the Nakagawa River,

2
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:23,900
kicking a pebble, leaping off with a bear.

3
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:29,360
To the Kashiwa type who
was always joking around,

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,800
they laugh that you're still just a kid.

5
00:00:34,350 --> 00:00:36,140
Somewhere, a bit of good spirit.

6
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,680
Even as a sound, it's all for real,
only that's certain.

7
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:41,940
One nightmare, the unchanging streets.

8
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,880
It's gentler, isn't it?

9
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:46,860
Because the crows are crying.

10
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:48,960
The pose gives it to you, doesn't it?

11
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:53,840
Are you really going to watch the yakitori?

12
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:11,100
Thank you for watching.

13
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:27,360
Ryotsu's movie debut

14
00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:34,880
Wonderful, it's perfect!

15
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:38,280
He really is a genius.

16
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:50,360
Yes, it's complete!

17
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:58,520
Look! It's a 1/250 scale model of the Tokyo Metropolitan Government building,
the one they say is the hardest for a manga artist to draw, so you know!

18
00:01:58,520 --> 00:02:01,900
Wow, it's so well made,
right down to the tiny details.

19
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:05,160
There's even the governor
