35
00:02:50,380 --> 00:02:54,340
Yes, he's a well-known
producer among the enthusiasts.

36
00:02:54,740 --> 00:03:02,900
That's right. And here is the famous world-renowned director,
the great master Camera Akira.

37
00:03:04,220 --> 00:03:12,800
Camera Akira, the director who made hits like "Odoru Daitokai
" and "Odoru Daikousaten," famous overseas too. Wow.

38
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,400
