like you to do it too.

48
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:46,120
Say "Director Camerada" at any
bar and you'll be mobbed by women.

49
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:47,320
Mobbed by women?

50
00:03:48,060 --> 00:03:49,520
That's amazing, Ryo-chan.

51
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:54,320
Director Camerada's new film has the whole world watching,
you know.

52
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:57,360
So what's this new film about?

53
00:03:58,160 --> 00:04:01,057
Yes, Dancing Big City,
Dancing Big Intersection,

54
00:04:01,107 --> 00:04:04,240
Dancing Big Carpenter,
and Dancing Big Bonfire, following on from

55
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:06,620
