77
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:04,440
Of course, the pay is great too.

78
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:05,800
If the film becomes a hit,

79
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:10,340
you'll get 1% of the abolished...
1% will be yours.

80
00:05:11,780 --> 00:05:16,660
So if it earns 1 billion,
that's 10 million; if it makes 10 billion,

81
00:05:17,900 --> 00:05:24,100
