Then it's settled. Sign right here.

82
00:05:25,540 --> 00:05:32,020
Filming starts in one week. You absolutely,
absolutely have to make it in time by then.

83
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:34,620
Hey, it's fine.

84
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:36,680
