Later, let's put out a video with
only Reiko's scenes stitched together,

261
00:16:09,479 --> 00:16:11,620
and we'll rake in a fortune
through the back channels!

262
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:15,020
Alright, we're rolling!

263
00:16:15,920 --> 00:16:16,620
Yeah!

264
00:16:22,340 --> 00:16:24,400
Filming starts, action!

265
00:16:26,740 --> 00:16:29,140
Incidents don't only
happen in conference rooms,

266
00:16:29,140 --> 00:16:31,780
they happen at the candy store
on Kameari's bookstore street!

267
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:35,220
Thief, stop!

268
00:16:38,740 --> 00:16:40,540
Okay, cut! Let's move on to the next one.

269
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:48,060
Why do I have to take a bath
out here in the middle of town?

270
00:16:48,820 --> 00:16:53,820
Now, now, now, this scene is
absolutely essential and important, so

271
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:07,900
Hey

272
00:17:07,900 --> 00:17:08,920
Aaaaaah!

273
00:17:16,460 --> 00:17:19,780
Happily, the movie wrapped today.

274
00:17:19,780 --> 00:17:21,420
Today's break order!

275
00:17:21,420 --> 00:17:22,820
Go for it, don't hold back.

276
00:17:22,820 --> 00:17:24,720
Eeeeeeh?

277
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:26,440
2

278
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:27,260
Now then, Ryuji!

279
00:17:28,340 --> 00:17:30,180
We can't lose either!

280
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:32,380
Let's go, special detectives!

281
00:17:32,500 --> 00:17:34,560
Ruri-rin, I'm taking it off!

282
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:36,140
Go for it!

283
00:17:36,420 --> 00:17:37,500
Woohoo!

284
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:40,920
Ugh, Ryo-chan always gets carried away.

285
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:44,380
Once he gets like this, nobody can stop him.

286
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:56,000
Publicity is important!

287
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:58,940
We'll promote it big and really hype it up!

288
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:03,160
This film the whole
world has been waiting for!

289
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:06,060
A masterpiece:
Director Kankichi Ryotsu's debut work!

290
00:18:06,060 --> 00:18:08,020
Dancing Great Kameari

291
00:18:08,020 --> 00:18:09,500
Finally complete!

292
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:13,900
Japan gets the first road show, ahead of the world.
Premiere confirmed!

293
00:18:28,940 --> 00:18:32,060
We owe this one to Nakagawa
and Reiko's connections, too.

294
00:18:32,060 --> 00:18:35,120
It's sure to be a huge hit, senpai.

295
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:39,540
This will make not 1 billion,
but 10 billion.

296
00:18:39,540 --> 00:18:42,320
No, it'll probably reach
20 or even 30 billion.

297
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:56,260
Ladies and gentlemen,

298
00:19:01,500 --> 00:19:02,860
Thank you for your patience.

299
00:19:03,780 --> 00:19:06,700
Now, the greatest epic of this century

300
00:19:06,700 --> 00:19:12,520
that our sponsors have been waiting for,
Odoru Dai-Kameari, will now be shown.

301
00:19:14,840 --> 00:19:20,580
This film was conceived 15 years ago
and was said to be impossible to make.

302
00:19:21,060 --> 00:19:24,940
Today, thanks to the full cooperation
of the Kameari shopping street,

303
00:19:24,940 --> 00:19:28,340
it has finally been completed
after overcoming countless hardships.

304
00:19:28,860 --> 00:19:32,540
You always come up with so
many glib excuses on the spot.

305
00:19:32,540 --> 00:19:34,660
Typical of you, senpai.

306
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:43,440
So, please enjoy the rest of Odoru Dai-Kameari,
a masterpiece people will talk about for generations, at your leisure.

307
00:20:01,260 --> 00:20:03,540
The action isn't happening
in the conference room,

308
00:20:03,540 --> 00:20:06,220
it's happening at the candy
shop on Kameari shopping street.

309
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:09,540
Drum roll, please!

310
00:20:09,540 --> 00:20:09,900
One!

311
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:13,260
It's really captivating.

312
00:20:13,620 --> 00:20:14,215
Damn it,

313
00:20:14,265 --> 00:20:18,140
the candy shop was the biggest sponsor,
after all.

314
00:20:18,960 --> 00:20:19,320
Two!

315
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:22,560
Prepare yourself, enemy of my father!

316
00:20:23,260 --> 00:20:25,600
Hahaha, as if that could ever happen!

317
00:20:26,300 --> 00:20:27,380
Here I come!

318
00:20:29,800 --> 00:20:33,060
Bookshelf King, flyer-hidden Jester!

319
00:20:36,560 --> 00:20:37,400
Where to?

320
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:43,120
Here it is, here it is!

321
00:20:43,740 --> 00:20:44,560
Let's go!

322
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:48,600
The ramen set at Tsurukame-ken
on Kameari Shopping Street

323
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:52,080
comes with ramen, rice,
gyoza, and pickles for 650 yen.

324
00:20:52,080 --> 00:20:53,340
As if you could beat me!

325
00:20:53,340 --> 00:20:54,640
Pfft, that's nothing.

326
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:56,980
Kikuchi Dairy's bargain
day is every Thursday.

327
00:20:56,980 --> 00:20:59,020
What a very spacious ballroom!

328
00:20:59,860 --> 00:21:02,880
At Tsurukame-ken,
it's from 11 a.m. to 2 p.m.

329
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:05,580
Noodle dishes come with
a free soft-boiled egg.

330
00:21:07,420 --> 00:21:12,140
For every 500 yen spent, collect 20 stamps on your
card and you'll get 500 yen cashback, you know.

331
00:21:12,900 --> 00:21:18,120
The sugar on sale at Kameari
Shopping Street was so cheap,

332
00:21:18,120 --> 00:21:20,160
so I got carried away buying
too much and ended up late.

333
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:22,660
Where's the culprit? Where's the culprit?

334
00:21:22,660 --> 00:21:29,560
Lu-lu-lu la-la-la,
one step in the circle of action.

335
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:34,740
Sprouting wings, Fight Green, Fight Green!

336
00:21:34,740 --> 00:21:37,780
The Janken Three Brothers

337
00:21:40,260 --> 00:21:41,260
Hot stones!

338
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:47,720
Shut up!

339
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:57,480
At the bathhouse we'll be going
into on Kameari shopping street,

340
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:59,660
refresh yourself from the day's fatigue.

341
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:02,600
We'll be waiting for everyone at Kame-no-yu!

342
00:22:03,500 --> 00:22:06,660
A photo book of handsome
Nakagawa and F-cup Reiko!

343
00:22:06,660 --> 00:22:09,360
On sale now, released alongside the film!

344
00:22:10,320 --> 00:22:12,020
What is this, Ryo-chan!

345
00:22:12,020 --> 00:22:14,520
So you secretly made a
photo book behind our backs!

346
00:22:14,880 --> 00:22:18,700
You were planning to make money through
the back door without even asking us!

347
00:22:19,100 --> 00:22:20,160
How awful!

348
00:22:24,500 --> 00:22:25,740
Ban invoked!

349
00:22:26,580 --> 00:22:28,900
The mistake that's going to
drive the whole nation crazy!

350
00:22:31,920 --> 00:22:33,840
You actually filmed all the way out there?

351
00:22:33,840 --> 00:22:36,880
But you told me to film everything.

352
00:22:37,420 --> 00:22:39,660
You left the editing up to me, after all.

353
00:22:40,300 --> 00:22:43,080
Wait, could it be... that after this...

354
00:22:45,360 --> 00:22:48,860
Yay!

355
00:22:48,860 --> 00:22:50,980
Yeah!

356
00:22:53,480 --> 00:22:56,520
This is the real Odoru Dai-Kameari!

357
00:22:56,520 --> 00:22:59,980
Ruruli won't lose either!
Odoru Medium-Kameari!

358
00:23:00,540 --> 00:23:03,780
Mine is the Odoru Super-Giant Kameari!

359
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:15,020
This is bad, isn't it?

360
00:23:16,820 --> 00:23:22,880
W-what is this?

361
00:23:23,720 --> 00:23:26,000
You don't like this sort of thing?

362
00:23:26,700 --> 00:23:28,320
Screw that!

363
00:23:33,880 --> 00:23:38,300
Get back here! What the hell were you thinking,
showing us this crap?!

364
00:23:38,780 --> 00:23:40,020
Go for it!

365
00:23:40,380 --> 00:23:44,300
Noooo! My 30 billion yen dream!

366
00:23:56,520 --> 00:24:01,980
I walked,
looking back on the time after the rain.

367
00:24:01,980 --> 00:24:11,580
Led by the gacha machine's hand,
the strange feeling I had back then,

368
00:24:12,500 --> 00:24:22,820
so I tried walking only on the
black tiles of the arcade street.

369
00:24:25,320 --> 00:24:30,960
Everyone was a child once,
but they've all forgotten.

370
00:24:32,060 --> 00:24:38,400
Even the politicians with their self-important
faces and the blue-eyeshadowed aunties,

371
00:24:38,940 --> 00:24:44,000
try turning at that corner over there.

372
00:24:45,040 --> 00:24:49,160
You'll get to meet everyone, everyone.

373
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:57,160
Over there is Kame-ari surely Kame-ari.

374
00:24:57,160 --> 00:25:02,460
Everyone, come on over to our town!

375
00:25:04,000 --> 00:25:10,280
Over there is Kame-ari surely Kame-ari.

376
00:25:11,140 --> 00:25:15,600
Everyone, come on over to our town!

377
00:25:21,360 --> 00:25:23,540
Honda got dumped and took up haiku.

378
00:25:23,540 --> 00:25:25,620
On top of that,
he became a child's apprentice.

379
00:25:25,620 --> 00:25:26,600
What is that supposed to be?

380
00:25:26,600 --> 00:25:28,660
Even I could write something like that.

381
00:25:28,660 --> 00:25:30,340
Alright, how about this one?

382
00:25:30,340 --> 00:25:33,260
Dumped by Otohime,
Honda goes on a huge rampage!

383
00:25:33,260 --> 00:25:35,960
Next time: Dash along the
Narrow Road to the Deep North!

384
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:37,060
Take care, then.

385
00:25:38,740 --> 00:25:40,740
Over there, turtles abound. (Kame-ari)

386
00:25:42,000 --> 00:25:44,100
Well, I'm sure there are turtles.

387
00:25:45,360 --> 00:25:49,280
Everyone, come on over to our town!

388
00:25:50,240 --> 00:25:50,920
Thank you.

